      "value": "@{64f8e8d313b550392ac6b63b|full_name} From what I understand, it seems that what you are requesting differs slightly from the topic of this post.\n\nThis Canny entry is a bug report, not a feature request.\n\nWhat we are asking for here is for the amount of UI pointer jitter not to be affected by the “Forced Camera Near Distance” setting.\n\nIf necessary, please feel free to submit your idea as a separate post under Feature Requests — that would help ensure it reaches the right place for consideration.",
