  "details": "I don't know exactly since when, but I noticed that nowadays I am having insane pointer jitter when far away from spawn. This is especially apparent on desktop, but the curser jitters internally in VR just the same, it's just not visible.\n\nThis also affects VRChats Launchpad to some degree.\n\nIt really interferes with using UI in worlds, as it makes pressing buttons very difficult.\n\nSee the attached video.\n\nLocation is at -10, -7, 500 in Unity\n\nI assume we are having some float issues.",
